299
00:14:32.168 --> 00:14:33.795
Resultados de síntese isolados.

300
00:14:33.836 --> 00:14:35.167
de processamento .

301
00:14:35.204 --> 00:14:36.671
Deixar de pé.

302
00:14:40.342 --> 00:14:41.468
Venha para dentro.

303
00:14:41.510 --> 00:14:42.636
